## Interface: 50504, 16001
## Title: WowVision Navigation
## Notes: Acoustic route guidance for blind players. Reads game state only and never controls the character.
## Author: Projekt WowVision Navigation
## Version: 1.0
## SavedVariables: WowVisionNavigationDB
## OptionalDeps: Questie

# Interface line: comma separated versions (MoP Classic 5.5.4 first, WoW Forever 1.60.1 second); a client ignores the
# entries that do not match it. The data files under maps/ are loaded at login as compact strings and decoded per zone
# on demand (concept chapter 7a).

